#. あんた達の誰かが…
msgctxt "0001 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid "It was one of you..."
msgstr ""

#. さくらちゃんを
#. 殺したんだよ！
msgctxt "0002 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid "One of you killed Sakura!"
msgstr ""

#. なぜ、俺達が
#. 犯人だと思うんだ？
msgctxt "0003 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid "And what reason do you have for saying so?"
msgstr ""

#. 動機があるからだよ…！
msgctxt "0004 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid "Because you all had a motive!"
msgstr ""

#. あんた達はさくらちゃんを
#. <CLT 9>憎んでた<CLT>じゃん！
msgctxt "0005 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid "You <CLT 9>hated her<CLT>!"
msgstr ""

#. それだけか…
#. 話にならんな…
msgctxt "0006 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid "Is that it? That doesn't make any sense..."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 9>それだけの理由<CLT>で
#. 人を疑うなんて…
msgctxt "0007 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid ""
"That's <CLT 9>the only reason you have<CLT>\n"
"for accusing us?"
msgstr ""

#. サイテーよ…
#. 人としてサイテーだわ…！
msgctxt "0008 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid ""
"That's l-low... That's about\n"
"as low a-as you can g-get!"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 26>な、なにぃ…！？<CLT>
msgctxt "0009 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid "<CLT 26>Wh-What!?<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 26>フン…くだらん。<CLT>
msgctxt "0010 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid "<CLT 26>Hmph. Idiotic.<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 26>十分な動機だよ！<CLT>
msgctxt "0011 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid "<CLT 26>That's reason enough!<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 26>そうよ…そうよ！<CLT>
msgctxt "0012 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid "<CLT 26>Yeah... Yeah!<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 26>…いきなり面白展開、いいよ！<CLT>
msgctxt "0013 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid "<CLT 26>Things have suddenly gotten interesting. Good!<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 26>そんなのないべ！<CLT>
msgctxt "0014 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid "<CLT 26>There's no reason!<CLT>"
msgstr ""
